diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..5fc7b167
--- /dev/null
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
+# swayfx agent notes
+
+Wayland compositor fork of sway with GLES2 effects (blur, shadows, rounded corners). C, meson build. Single repo; builds `sway`, `swaymsg`, `swaybar`, `swaynag`.
+
+## Build & run
+
+Dependencies: meson, ninja, wlroots 0.20 (>=0.20.0, <0.21.0), scenefx 0.5, wayland >=1.21, wayland-protocols >=1.41, pcre2, json-c >=0.13, pango, cairo, pangocairo, xkbcommon >=1.5.0, libdrm, libevdev. Optional: gdk-pixbuf2, libinput, libudev, scdoc (man pages), systemd/elogind/basu (tray).
+
+```
+meson setup build/
+ninja -C build/
+sudo ninja -C build/ install
+```
+
+meson defaults: `werror=true`, `warning_level=2`, `c_std=c11`, `wrap_mode=nodownload`. `build/` is gitignored.
+
+Nix:
+```
+nix build            # -> ./result/bin/sway
+nix develop          # dev shell; copies scenefx to ./subprojects/, adds gdb, disables fortify
+./result/bin/sway
+```
+
+Docker:
+```
+docker compose up --build
+# then copy opt/ files to /usr/local/ (see README "Container (Docker)")
+```
+
+Debian: see INSTALL-deb.md (needs liblcms2, libliftoff, libdisplay-info for wlroots 0.19 backend; run `sudo ldconfig` after install).
+
+No test suite or formatter/linter config in repo. `.editorconfig` only: tabs for C, LF, utf-8.
+
+## Entry points
+
+- `sway/main.c` -> `sway` executable (compositor; IPC server)
+- `swaymsg/main.c` -> `swaymsg` (IPC client)
+- `swaybar/main.c` -> `swaybar` (bar, gated on `swaybar` option)
+- `swaynag/main.c` -> `swaynag` (nag, gated on `swaynag` option)
+- `common/` shared lib (`lib_sway_common`); `include/` public headers
+- `protocols/` wayland protocol XMLs (layer-shell, output-power-management)
+
+Subprojects `wlroots` and `scenefx` fall back to `subprojects/` dir (gitignored). `nix develop` populates `subprojects/scenefx`.
+
+## Code style
+
+C11, POSIX, no GNU extensions. Kernel-style C: brackets on same line, single tab indent, 80 col target (max 100). Global names prefixed `sway_submodule_` (e.g. `sway_output`). Construct/destruct pairs: `init`/`finish` (no alloc) or `create`/`destroy` (malloc/free, destroy accepts NULL). Non-void functions return bool. Include guards: header path relative to `include/`, uppercased. See CONTRIBUTING.md for full style.
+
+## Gotchas
+
+- `werror=true`: warnings fail the build.
+- No logind/seatd: `sudo chmod a+s /usr/local/bin/sway` (sway drops root after startup).
+- `subprojects/`, `result`, `opt/`, `build/` are gitignored.
+- Version string embeds short git commit + branch; only set in a git checkout.
+- Only CI workflow: `.github/workflows/flake-update.yml` (weekly Nix lock update PR).
+- Contributions: pull requests from feature branches; commit subject <= 50 chars; include a test plan. Discuss non-eye-candy features in an issue first (scope is eye-candy).
